{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Have you kept every female alive?</b> Even though in the war against any nation other than the seven nations it is written: רַק הַנָּשִׁים וְהַטַּף וְהַבְּהֵמָה וְכֹל אֲשֶׁר יִהְיֶה בָעִיר כָּל שְׁלָלָהּ תָּבֹז לָךְ (Deuteronomy 20:14) — you should not have kept alive those very women whom you recognized had been a stumbling block for you through the matter of Balaam."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:41:24.326344559Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}